# Supabase Standards

Assume Supabase Cloud.

Use native platform features whenever possible.

Supported:

- auth
- RLS
- Storage
- Vault
- pg_cron
- pg_net
- Realtime

Rules

Never duplicate Supabase functionality.

Every tenant table requires RLS unless intentionally public.

Policies should reuse helper functions.

Never expose cross-tenant data.

Platform functions belong only in 000.